    "notes_intro_relaxed": {"en": "I couldn't find notes specifically about \"{other}\", but here are notes for {topic}:", "ne": "\"{other}\" को बारेमा विशेष नोट भेटिएन, तर {topic} का नोटहरू यी हुन्:", "rn": "\"{other}\" ko barema bishesh note bhetiyena, tara {topic} ka notes haru yi hun:"},
